  "goodToKnow": "Die Lebenszeit is one's lifetime: auf Lebenszeit (for life), as in Beamter auf Lebenszeit, a German civil servant with lifetime tenure, which makes Beamte very hard to dismiss. Federal constitutional judges serve one twelve-year term. Colloquially, Das war verschwendete Lebenszeit means that was a waste of time. Lebenslang means lifelong, and a life sentence is lebenslange Haft. It has no plural."
